WEBVTT

00:04.737 --> 00:07.157
You don't think the real chance is 0%?

00:08.077 --> 00:13.657
The chance that quest B408 
succeeds, and Grid rescues Huroi.

00:14.167 --> 00:16.747
Maybe Morpheus threw an error?

00:16.747 --> 00:19.947
No, we haven't received 
any reports on that...

00:19.947 --> 00:22.897
I know. I'm just on edge.

00:22.897 --> 00:25.687
Sharing the quest changed the scenario,

00:26.107 --> 00:29.007
and now it can't calculate 
the exact probability.

00:29.497 --> 00:34.067
Let's just hope that 
Grid can pull this off.

00:34.577 --> 00:39.057
He has a legendary job, 
but he's only level 21.

00:39.467 --> 00:40.697
This sucks.

01:03.277 --> 01:04.807
<b>Overgeared</b>

01:04.807 --> 01:08.037
<b>Overgeared</b>

02:13.557 --> 02:16.447
The theme of the match is "daggers."

02:16.447 --> 02:21.457
The one who makes the better 
dagger in three hours wins!

02:21.457 --> 02:25.337
<i>I'm Pagma's Successor! 
The legendary blacksmith!</i>

02:25.647 --> 02:27.177
<i>I refuse to lose!</i>

02:29.857 --> 02:32.957
<i>First, let's see what you've got.</i>

02:33.627 --> 02:35.847
<i>Skill: Observe.</i>

02:36.987 --> 02:39.847
<b>Unable to analyze target's skills!</b>

02:40.217 --> 02:42.817
<i>Your skill level is too low.</i>

02:42.817 --> 02:43.727
<i>How?</i>

02:44.237 --> 02:48.157
<i>I've copied skills from higher-ranked 
NPC blacksmiths before!</i>

02:48.777 --> 02:51.737
<i>Don't tell me he's an epic class...</i>

02:52.177 --> 02:54.587
<i>No. That's impossible.</i>

02:54.587 --> 02:59.747
<i>The only epic class holders 
are Roy, Agnus, and me!</i>

02:59.747 --> 03:03.057
<i>I'll just have to do this another way.</i>

03:07.757 --> 03:09.787
Okay, looking good!

03:09.787 --> 03:12.757
Khan-sama, please come to the stage!

03:13.207 --> 03:15.387
Miss Erina has a suggestion:

03:15.387 --> 03:19.157
if you're master and apprentice, 
you should do this together!

03:19.157 --> 03:19.777
Huh?

03:22.357 --> 03:24.007
Fine by me.

03:24.007 --> 03:25.347
So now it's two on one?

03:25.347 --> 03:26.647
A handicap?

03:26.647 --> 03:29.897
Damn it! That little 
brat thinks I can't win?

03:30.227 --> 03:32.797
<i>His teacher should be good.</i>

03:31.757 --> 03:33.857
<b>High-Ranked Blacksmith Skill</b>

03:34.397 --> 03:36.867
<i>I'm borrowing your power.</i>

03:36.867 --> 03:37.597
<b>High-Ranked Blacksmith Skill</b>

03:38.947 --> 03:40.847
<i>Your Skill Copy was successful.</i>

03:40.847 --> 03:42.867
<i>Okay! And now the tools...</i>

03:40.847 --> 03:43.947
<i>You can use this skill once.</i>

03:47.267 --> 03:50.117
Okay! Now the game begins!

03:50.527 --> 03:52.277
<b>Blessed Blacksmith's Hammer</b>

03:52.277 --> 03:55.337
Erina! Erina!

03:55.337 --> 03:57.007
<i>I'm going to win!</i>

03:57.007 --> 04:00.057
<i>I can feel every shift of 
the iron beneath my hammer.</i>

04:00.057 --> 04:02.057
<i>We're working in perfect sync!</i>

04:03.037 --> 04:04.557
<i>It's looking good!</i>

04:45.687 --> 04:47.937
It's beautiful.

04:47.937 --> 04:51.497
I'm proud to have helped 
create such a masterpiece.

04:51.497 --> 04:53.437
We still have more materials.

04:56.447 --> 05:01.247
<i>I paid ten gold for this minotaur 
horn so I could win this quest.</i>

05:01.557 --> 05:04.157
<i>I refuse to lose!</i>

05:10.017 --> 05:12.327
Okay! I'm finished!

05:13.527 --> 05:15.217
Look at that!

05:15.217 --> 05:18.837
A dagger as beautiful as its creator!

05:19.567 --> 05:23.967
<i>I hate to admit it, but it's a great item.</i>

05:24.617 --> 05:27.317
Now, let's look at its stats!

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b>Dagger of Temptation</b>

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>Class: Epic

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>m 0 0 l 105 0 105 5 0 5

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>Durability

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>m 0 0 l 50 0 50 6 0 6

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>Attack

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>m 0 0 l 50 0 50 7 0 7

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>* Attack Speed

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>m 0 0 l 50 0 50 5 0 5

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>* Chance to charm an enemy

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>* If attack is blocked, durability will decrease faster

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>m 0 0 l 325 0 325 22 0 22

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>Equip Conditions: Level 100, Agility 200+, Intelligence 30+

05:29.717 --> 05:32.687
<b></b>Intermediate Dagger Mastery

05:32.687 --> 05:33.687
<b>Dagger of Temptation</b>

05:33.687 --> 05:35.347
"Epic"?

05:35.347 --> 05:37.457
And the stats are amazing!

05:37.457 --> 05:39.567
The match is as good as over!

05:40.077 --> 05:41.727
Erina-sama is incredible!

05:46.807 --> 05:49.457
Thank you, everyone!

05:47.017 --> 05:49.457
She's as good as I am.

05:49.937 --> 05:52.207
Impressive, given her age.

05:52.817 --> 05:56.217
But she's no match for you.

05:56.997 --> 05:58.907
Right, Grid?

05:59.717 --> 06:01.907
Yes. Of course.

06:01.907 --> 06:04.747
<i>"Breath of the Legendary 
Blacksmith" activated.</i>

06:04.747 --> 06:06.377
<i>Crafted item's stats will increase.</i>

06:06.377 --> 06:07.177
I'm...

06:08.567 --> 06:10.347
done, too!

06:10.347 --> 06:12.727
I'm sure the crowd will be in awe!

06:15.237 --> 06:16.147
Don't move!

06:16.907 --> 06:18.277
Huroi confessed!

06:18.277 --> 06:21.737
He said you're a traitor 
to Earl Steim, too!

06:24.537 --> 06:26.657
What's going on?

06:27.517 --> 06:31.107
Huroi shouldn't have the 
strength left to speak.

06:31.107 --> 06:33.447
And getting those guards 
to act would take...

06:33.917 --> 06:37.017
You did this before the 
match began, didn't you?

06:38.417 --> 06:41.047
I'm a cautious man.

06:41.667 --> 06:44.967
Are you saying you didn't trust me?

06:44.967 --> 06:46.497
What if I didn't?

06:46.497 --> 06:48.307
You're a rabbit in a little hutch.

06:48.307 --> 06:50.807
Are you going to bite your master...

06:51.477 --> 06:52.887
Rabbit?

06:54.617 --> 06:58.757
Khan, looks like you'll have 
to give up your forge!

06:59.147 --> 07:02.487
You set us up, Valmont!

07:00.667 --> 07:03.527
Let me go! Let me go, damn it!

07:03.527 --> 07:05.047
I'm just a blacksmith!

07:05.047 --> 07:09.497
Damn it! Let me go!

07:14.627 --> 07:16.457
<i>This is bullshit.</i>

07:16.457 --> 07:19.027
<i>What happens to the item match quest?</i>

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>Quest

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b>Item Creation Match with the Mero Company</b>

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>The Mero Company has challenged you in a battle for the forge.

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b>m 0 0 l 255 0 255 55 0 55</b>

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>Khan is in poor shape and has asked you to participate in his stead.

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>Clear Condition: Win the Mero Company's match

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>Clear Reward: 600 gold prize

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>+500 Fame in Winston

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>Failure: Fame in Winston becomes 1.

07:18.857 --> 07:21.197
<b></b>Khan loses his forge to the Mero Company.

07:19.877 --> 07:21.197
<i>System guidance.</i>

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Hidden Quest

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b>Apostle of Justice</b>

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>You've been locked in an underground prison!

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b>m 0 0 l 255 0 255 86 0 86</b>

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Rescue Huroi, who is trapped on the lowest level,

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>and deliver justice to the villagers of Winston!

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Clear Condition: Rescue Huroi within 7 hours

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Clear Reward: Title "Apostle of Justice"

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>* Apostle of Justice: "Courage" stat is unlocked.

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>All stats +10.

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Skill "Unyielding Justice" earned.

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Failure: Level -2

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Title "Coward"

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>*Coward: Reputation with NPCs decreases.

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>Chance of new quests decreases.

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<b></b>NPCs with a strong sense of justice will dislike you.

07:21.197 --> 07:23.137
<i>The quest has changed.</i>

07:23.137 --> 07:23.817
What?!

07:23.817 --> 07:26.967
<i>Your new quest is 
"Apostle of Justice (S)."</i>

07:25.387 --> 07:31.387
<b></b>Hidden Quest
<b>Apostle of Justice (S)

</b>You've been locked in an underground prison!
Rescue Huroi, who is trapped on the lowest level,
and deliver justice to the villagers of Winston!

Clear Condition: Rescue Huroi within 7 hours
Clear Reward: Title "Apostle of Justice"
* Apostle of Justice: "Courage" stat is unlocked.
All stats +10.
Skill "Unyielding Justice" earned.

Failure: Level -2
Title "Coward"
*Coward: Reputation with NPCs decreases.
Chance of new quests decreases.
NPCs with a strong sense of justice will dislike you.

07:25.387 --> 07:31.387
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 71 0 71</b>

07:26.967 --> 07:30.507
<i>This is a two-person quest with Huroi.</i>

07:30.507 --> 07:32.437
<i>This clear reward...</i>

07:32.437 --> 07:33.867
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 56 0 56</b>

07:32.437 --> 07:33.867
<b></b>You have abandoned the Mero Company's quest
 to persuade the villagers and promised to go to the
capital "Frontier" to tell Earl Steim of their misdeeds!

Clear Condition: Fend off the company's
attacks and meet with Earl Steim
 Clear Reward: Title "Apostle of Justice"
* Apostle of Justice: "Courage" stat is unlocked.
All stats +10.
Skill "Unyielding Justice" earned.

Failure: Be caught by the Mero Company.
Level -1
 Banned from Winston until a new lord takes over.

07:33.957 --> 07:37.267
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 60 0 60</b>

07:33.957 --> 07:37.267
<b></b>You've been locked in an underground prison!
Rescue Huroi, who is trapped on the lowest level,
and deliver justice to the villagers of Winston!

Clear Condition: Rescue Huroi within 7 hours
Clear Reward: Title "Apostle of Justice"
* Apostle of Justice: "Courage" stat is unlocked.
All stats +10.
Skill "Unyielding Justice" earned.

Failure: Level -2
Title "Coward"
*Coward: Reputation with NPCs decreases.
Chance of new quests decreases.
NPCs with a strong sense of justice will dislike you.

07:34.217 --> 07:37.267
<i>It's the same as the 
quest Huroi showed me!</i>

07:37.607 --> 07:41.157
<i>So there was another quest hidden 
within the Item Creation Match?</i>

07:41.527 --> 07:44.417
<i>Wait, now I'm captured, too!</i>

07:41.527 --> 07:52.287
<b></b>Clear Condition: Rescue Huroi within 7 hours
Clear Reward: Title "Apostle of Justice"
* Apostle of Justice: "Courage" stat is unlocked.
All stats +10.
Skill "Unyielding Justice" earned.

Failure: Level -2
Title "Coward"
*Coward: Reputation with NPCs decreases.
Chance of new quests decreases.
NPCs with a strong sense of justice will dislike you.

07:41.527 --> 07:52.287
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 46 0 46</b>

07:44.417 --> 07:46.957
<i>How do I rescue him?</i>

07:46.957 --> 07:49.177
<i>And the penalty is bullshit!</i>

07:49.177 --> 07:51.457
<i>I'm not doing this! Screw this quest!</i>

07:50.887 --> 07:52.287
<b>This quest cannot be abandoned</b>

07:52.517 --> 07:54.187
<i>This is bullshit!</i>

07:54.187 --> 07:57.037
<i>Why does this keep happening to me?!</i>

08:00.957 --> 08:05.677
<i>I've seen many items during my time 
at the Mero Company, and I can tell...</i>

08:07.007 --> 08:10.157
<i>It would be no exaggeration to say his 
skills are the best on the continent.</i>

08:11.877 --> 08:13.077
A complete defeat.

08:13.077 --> 08:14.057
Ridiculous.

08:14.567 --> 08:17.817
The crowd was sure Erina won.

08:17.817 --> 08:19.187
Hide that thing.

08:20.097 --> 08:20.937
Hey.

08:21.397 --> 08:24.507
The company got
what it wanted, right?

08:24.847 --> 08:26.947
I'm taking that reward.

08:26.947 --> 08:28.297
Yes.

08:28.297 --> 08:30.827
We must keep our promises.

08:31.377 --> 08:32.697
<i>Quest clear.</i>

08:32.807 --> 08:35.847
<b>Title</b>

08:32.807 --> 08:35.847
<b>Player of Games</b>

08:32.807 --> 08:35.847
<b>Earned</b>

08:33.177 --> 08:35.167
<i>A title has been earned.</i>

08:37.427 --> 08:40.127
I would've lost if it hadn't been 
for that interruption, right?

08:40.127 --> 08:44.487
Perhaps it really is true that 
he's Pagma's Successor...

08:45.437 --> 08:46.577
Euphemina-san.

08:47.497 --> 08:50.657
May I ask you to do one other thing?

08:53.117 --> 08:55.297
Everyone, do you have your weapons?!

08:55.297 --> 08:56.527
Yeah!

08:56.817 --> 08:59.147
First, we rescue Huroi and Grid!

08:59.497 --> 09:01.917
This time, we'll win our freedom!

09:03.747 --> 09:06.527
I knew you'd try something like this.

09:06.887 --> 09:11.637
I must arrest those who would 
rebel against their lord.

09:12.167 --> 09:13.657
Valmont...

09:13.657 --> 09:15.497
Don't worry.

09:15.497 --> 09:18.037
I'll take good care of your forge.

09:19.537 --> 09:22.177
What a piece of shit!

09:23.047 --> 09:27.047
<b></b>Quest

09:23.047 --> 09:27.047
<b><b>Waiting</b></b>

09:23.047 --> 09:27.047
<b><b>Time Remaining</b></b>

09:28.267 --> 09:31.557
Six more hours...

09:37.697 --> 09:39.227
This is dangerous!

09:39.717 --> 09:41.727
We have to log him out!

09:41.727 --> 09:46.487
If something happens to Huroi, people 
will think the game itself is dangerous.

09:46.737 --> 09:50.177
Grid was supposed to rescue him,
but he's still in his cell.

09:50.497 --> 09:54.617
It seems impossible to entrust the fate 
of our company to this low-level user...

09:54.617 --> 09:58.017
The current odds of his 
rescue are less than 1%!

09:59.787 --> 10:01.707
Grid is low-level,

10:01.707 --> 10:04.757
but he's exceeded our expectations before.

10:05.307 --> 10:09.327
The chance that he'll unlock 
a second job is not zero.

10:11.947 --> 10:15.317
Let's bet on him.

10:17.017 --> 10:21.767
<b></b>Quest

10:17.017 --> 10:21.767
<b><b>Apostle of Justice</b></b>

10:17.017 --> 10:21.767
<b><b>Time Remaining</b></b>

10:17.817 --> 10:20.357
<i>One hour remaining
until the quest expires.</i>

10:21.767 --> 10:25.277
<i>If the goddess of luck exists...</i>

10:25.277 --> 10:28.937
<i>I want to punch her in the face!</i>

10:29.527 --> 10:31.407
Grid.

10:31.407 --> 10:33.407
Grid.

10:33.407 --> 10:35.097
Grid!

10:33.407 --> 10:35.777
<i>What's that brat doing here?</i>

10:35.777 --> 10:36.787
Grid!

10:36.787 --> 10:39.627
<i>Is she my goddess of luck?</i>

10:37.217 --> 10:42.727
Grid! Grid! Grid!

10:39.627 --> 10:41.787
<i>Either way, this is my chance!</i>

10:44.867 --> 10:46.947
Where <i>are</i> you?!

10:46.947 --> 10:48.677
I really hate that guy.

10:53.277 --> 10:55.507
D-Don't scare me like that!

10:55.507 --> 10:58.267
Let me out of here!!

10:59.777 --> 11:02.397
If you want me to rescue you,
I have terms.

11:02.397 --> 11:03.457
Terms?

11:03.877 --> 11:05.247
What d'ya mean?

11:04.997 --> 11:08.797
I want you to make me an item 
because of your abilities.

11:07.837 --> 11:08.797
Hmm?

11:12.497 --> 11:14.527
I'm saved!

11:14.527 --> 11:15.777
Here you go.

11:16.167 --> 11:18.157
Thanks, brat.

11:19.307 --> 11:23.017
I have a very cute name: Euphemina.

11:23.017 --> 11:24.857
Don't call me "brat."

11:24.857 --> 11:26.557
Euphemina-san...

11:26.557 --> 11:27.297
Yes?

11:29.797 --> 11:33.297
Did you really come to save 
me just to get an orb?

11:34.047 --> 11:36.827
You'll know when we get out of here.

11:36.827 --> 11:38.607
What the heck?

11:38.607 --> 11:41.297
How did a blacksmith get in here, anyway?

11:41.297 --> 11:44.057
I'm not a blacksmith.

11:44.617 --> 11:47.057
I'm a Duplicator. An epic job.

11:47.557 --> 11:52.237
During the item creation match,
I copied your master's skills.

11:52.237 --> 11:55.977
Epic? There are only 
three of those, right?

11:55.977 --> 11:56.877
Yeah.

11:56.877 --> 11:59.747
But your job is rarer 
than unique-class, right?

11:59.747 --> 12:01.287
Well...

12:02.237 --> 12:03.637
He's escaping!

12:03.637 --> 12:04.747
You won't get away!

12:05.267 --> 12:08.747
Damn it. Am I supposed to 
fight with just this dagger?

12:10.257 --> 12:11.627
<i>Unique?</i>

12:10.607 --> 12:15.887
<b>Dagger of Ideals</b>

12:10.817 --> 12:12.357
<b></b>Your understanding of <b>Dagger of Ideals</b>
has reached 100%

12:11.107 --> 12:12.567
<b><b>Dagger of Ideals</b>
Attack -20%








Conditional Effect -50%</b>

12:12.217 --> 12:14.487
<i>There are penalties, 
but it's super strong!</i>

12:12.737 --> 12:15.887
<b>Skills</b>

12:13.317 --> 12:13.427
<b></b>Fast Reflexes

12:13.397 --> 12:13.507
<b></b>Blade Wind

12:13.427 --> 12:15.887
<b></b>Fast Reflexes

12:13.507 --> 12:15.887
<b></b>Blade Wind

12:14.487 --> 12:15.887
<i>System guidance.</i>

12:15.887 --> 12:18.387
<i>You have gained a new skill.</i>

12:15.887 --> 12:17.357
Stop them!

12:21.897 --> 12:23.267
Take this!

12:24.067 --> 12:24.937
Blade Wind!

12:26.797 --> 12:29.067
Wow. So cool.

12:29.337 --> 12:30.687
Help me!

12:30.687 --> 12:32.527
We need to save Huroi!

12:32.527 --> 12:34.697
I don't like working for free.

12:34.697 --> 12:37.317
Just help me, brat!

12:38.587 --> 12:40.417
What did I just say?

12:40.727 --> 12:43.327
Don't call me that!

12:43.327 --> 12:45.327
Spear of Annihilation!

12:52.137 --> 12:53.717
Scary...

12:53.717 --> 12:55.427
There! I found them!

12:55.427 --> 12:57.767
I'm getting sick of these guys.

12:58.397 --> 12:58.967
Wait!

12:58.967 --> 13:00.467
Where do you think you're going?

13:00.467 --> 13:01.837
I'm going to look for Huroi!

13:01.837 --> 13:03.097
Hold them off!

13:04.277 --> 13:05.687
Get the girl first!

13:05.687 --> 13:06.927
Rush her!

13:08.667 --> 13:12.027
If I use too powerful a skill, 
it'll bring this place down.

13:12.447 --> 13:14.977
I wish I could use flame magic.

13:14.977 --> 13:16.777
But I can't here.

13:19.877 --> 13:22.407
Hurry up, Grid!

13:22.987 --> 13:25.117
<i>Five minutes remaining.</i>

13:24.747 --> 13:25.997
<b></b>Quest

13:24.747 --> 13:25.997
<b><b>Apostle of Justice</b></b>

13:24.747 --> 13:25.997
<b><b>Time Remaining</b></b>

13:25.117 --> 13:27.297
Damn it! I'm out of time!

13:28.537 --> 13:29.247
Over there!

13:30.897 --> 13:31.957
Where are you?!

13:35.147 --> 13:36.407
Down that hall?

13:40.407 --> 13:42.847
I am the Knight of Winston...

13:44.807 --> 13:45.847
Leo!

13:46.567 --> 13:49.557
<i>If he's a knight, he must 
be at least level 180.</i>

13:49.557 --> 13:51.107
<i>I'm level 21!</i>

13:51.107 --> 13:54.357
I won't let you get to Huroi!

13:55.037 --> 13:57.477
<i>The Blacksmith's Wrath has activated.</i>

13:57.477 --> 13:59.027
Fast Reflexes!

14:07.617 --> 14:08.577
Blade Wind!

14:12.937 --> 14:14.187
Damn you.

14:14.837 --> 14:15.627
So be it!

14:18.827 --> 14:21.137
My ultimate flame sword
will burn you

14:22.007 --> 14:26.017
until not even ash remains!

14:31.307 --> 14:35.727
Damn you... weakling...

14:35.837 --> 14:37.987
<b></b>Title<b>






Knightslayer</b>

14:36.017 --> 14:38.487
<i>You defeated the Knight of Winston.</i>

14:36.337 --> 14:37.987
<b></b>Obtained <b>Cell Key</b>

14:39.877 --> 14:41.657
<i>A title has been earned.</i>

14:41.657 --> 14:43.987
<i>You obtained Cell Key.</i>

14:43.987 --> 14:46.997
Don't underestimate my items!

14:46.997 --> 14:48.827
<i>Experience earned.</i>

