<i>You are currently level 45.</i>

14:52.907 --> 14:56.497
Yes!

15:09.047 --> 15:12.667
I was going to kick your 
ass when I found you,

15:12.667 --> 15:15.317
but you look half-dead already.

15:15.767 --> 15:18.257
You're Khan-san's...

15:18.757 --> 15:19.507
