15:22.527 --> 15:24.297
<i>Congratulations.</i>

15:24.297 --> 15:28.897
<i>You are the first player in 
</i>Satisfy<i> to unlock a second job.</i>

15:29.537 --> 15:33.837
<i>Your name will be passed down 
in this world for generations.</i>

15:35.057 --> 15:37.767
This is more than I could 
have ever imagined!

15:38.547 --> 15:41.507
I got Apostle of Justice!

15:41.507 --> 15:42.717
Grid-sama...

15:42.717 --> 15:43.927
Eh? "Sama"?

15:44.737 --> 15:47.567
I, Huroi, bearer of the 
blue wolf's blood...

15:48.177 --> 15:51.937
shall repay you for what 
you have done this day!

15:52.887 --> 15:56.177
I swear by my name as the 
Apostle of Justice's partner!

15:57.887 --> 15:59.457
Oh, sure.

16:04.577 --> 16:07.877
I can't believe they actually did it...

16:08.647 --> 16:12.157
Now all that's left is to escape.

16:17.177 --> 16:19.417
<i>I have just one skill left.</i>

16:19.697 --> 16:21.667
<i>But it's too powerful.</i>

16:23.167 --> 16:25.387
I'll avenge my comrades!

16:27.297 --> 16:28.557
Sorry about that.

16:30.167 --> 16:31.907
Took longer than I thought!

16:32.267 --> 16:33.687
Grid!

16:33.687 --> 16:34.647
Yeah.

16:34.647 --> 16:36.227
You seem to be doing well, too.

16:36.227 --> 16:40.197
You took your damn time! 
Idiot! Scum! Moron!

16:40.197 --> 16:42.187
Maybe I shouldn't have come.

16:45.007 --> 16:46.067
No!

16:56.307 --> 16:59.257
Huroi! Are you okay?

16:59.257 --> 17:00.207
Yes.

17:00.207 --> 17:04.587
<b>Skills</b>

17:00.207 --> 17:04.587
<b></b>Indomitable Will

17:00.207 --> 17:04.587
<b></b>Unyielding Justice

17:00.207 --> 17:04.587
<b></b>Sacrifice for Justice

17:00.487 --> 17:04.587
<i>I got a skill for surviving the quest.</i>

17:01.317 --> 17:04.587
<b>Indomitable Will</b>

17:01.317 --> 17:04.587
<b></b>* Neutralize any single attack for ten seconds.

17:06.177 --> 17:08.357
You two go on ahead.

17:08.667 --> 17:10.877
I'll hold them off.

17:11.607 --> 17:15.627
I swore I'd spend the rest of 
my life repaying my debt to you.

17:15.627 --> 17:17.427
Okay, sounds good!

17:17.427 --> 17:18.857
Wait for me!

17:18.857 --> 17:20.397
Wait! We won't let you get away!

17:20.397 --> 17:23.277
Stop where you are, bastards!

17:24.687 --> 17:25.507
I can't move!

17:25.507 --> 17:28.777
You scum are worse than trash.

17:28.777 --> 17:32.407
I'll slice you into pieces 
and feed you to the pigs.

17:32.877 --> 17:34.747
Taste my new skill!

17:36.547 --> 17:38.077
Unyielding Justice!

17:42.127 --> 17:45.217
<i>Grid-sama, good luck!</i>

17:52.687 --> 17:54.347
You thought you could get away?

17:55.407 --> 17:56.507
Do something!

17:56.507 --> 17:59.097
Hey, you idiot! Oh, damn it all!

17:59.097 --> 18:02.657
Out here, I can use something special!

18:04.857 --> 18:06.767
Demon King's Tail Fire!

18:30.897 --> 18:32.627
I feel a little better now.

18:33.217 --> 18:34.887
Scary...

18:34.887 --> 18:37.177
W-With one attack?

18:37.687 --> 18:39.507
I'll take it from here.

18:41.557 --> 18:44.637
Rabbit! You came to save me?

18:50.897 --> 18:53.577
Valmont, I'm turning you 
over to the authorities.

18:55.417 --> 18:57.077
You would betray me?

18:57.297 --> 19:00.417
I'm done with your way of doing things.

19:02.247 --> 19:03.487
And...

19:03.487 --> 19:05.997
I simply prioritized my own interests.

19:06.227 --> 19:08.257
I'm a merchant, after all.

19:08.977 --> 19:11.757
So yeah, I saved you.

19:12.017 --> 19:13.607
'Cause Rabbit asked me to.

19:14.057 --> 19:16.857
Oh, I see...

19:16.857 --> 19:17.847
Grid-san.

19:19.017 --> 19:21.917
I want to put my faith in you.

19:23.137 --> 19:25.457
Your talent is the real thing.

19:25.767 --> 19:30.027
But there are limits to the 
value you can generate alone.

19:30.027 --> 19:33.017
If you're willing to join me,

19:33.527 --> 19:36.607
I promise you success at my new company.

19:37.697 --> 19:38.907
You mean...

19:39.867 --> 19:42.417
I'll make you rich.

19:42.657 --> 19:44.787
Rich?!

19:44.787 --> 19:49.037
Hey, don't forget your deal with me.

19:49.037 --> 19:50.797
You owe me an orb.

19:50.797 --> 19:52.177
Leave it to me.

19:53.197 --> 19:54.547
That was easy.

19:54.547 --> 19:59.397
<i>You're going to give me the 
item recipe for free, brat!</i>

20:00.107 --> 20:01.527
Well, see you around!

20:05.087 --> 20:09.197
I'm going to start the new 
company from Khan-san's forge.

20:09.547 --> 20:12.057
I'll tell you the details another time.

20:12.737 --> 20:13.487
Yeah.

20:14.827 --> 20:15.737
I'm counting on you.

20:16.737 --> 20:20.747
<b>Huroi</b>

20:18.037 --> 20:23.897
Huroi seems healthy, but just to 
be safe, we've blocked his login.

20:24.327 --> 20:26.627
We'll make sure he gets some rest.

20:26.887 --> 20:31.897
The birth of <i>Satisfy</i>'s 
first user with two jobs.

20:31.877 --> 20:36.887
<b>Grid</b>

20:32.477 --> 20:36.887
Grid has once again made history, huh?

20:37.987 --> 20:40.577
Though he seems unaware of it.

20:42.077 --> 20:44.017
<i>Breaking news!</i>

20:44.247 --> 20:50.127
<i>The first user in the history 
of </i>Satisfy<i> to have two jobs!</i>

20:50.127 --> 20:51.147
What'd he say?

20:51.147 --> 20:54.527
<i>There are many benefits 
to having a second job.</i>

20:51.147 --> 20:58.907
<i>Satisfy'</i>s first holder of a second job!

20:54.527 --> 20:58.907
<i>I'm told you get two stat 
boosts when leveling up!</i>

20:59.207 --> 21:01.207
That's cheating...

20:59.207 --> 21:03.907
<i>Many users have been 
focusing on rare jobs,</i>

21:03.907 --> 21:08.167
<i>but now more users will 
attempt to get a second job!</i>

21:08.387 --> 21:12.087
<i>This will change </i>Satisfy<i> forever!</i>

21:19.187 --> 21:21.827
No word from Huroi, huh?

21:22.197 --> 21:24.837
Looks like he's still logged out.

21:25.557 --> 21:27.687
Well, guess it's none of my business!

21:28.077 --> 21:32.247
After all, thanks to Rabbit, I'm rich!

21:32.247 --> 21:34.607
<i></i>Satisfy<i>! Ready?</i>

21:35.607 --> 21:38.177
R-Rabbit was arrested, too?

21:38.177 --> 21:40.667
Yeah, he got ten years.

21:40.667 --> 21:42.237
Earl Steim is showing no mercy

21:42.237 --> 21:45.997
toward anyone involved with 
the Mero Company's evil deeds.

21:45.997 --> 21:47.877
Then what about the new company?!

21:47.877 --> 21:49.367
Not happening, obviously.

21:49.367 --> 21:50.497
When do I get to be rich?!

21:50.497 --> 21:52.317
You don't.

21:56.157 --> 22:00.967
Oh, Earl Steim is going to do a 
better job running the village.

22:00.967 --> 22:04.017
He's sent someone new.

22:05.067 --> 22:07.457
His daughter.
